@startuml
title Authenticated Tenant Request — Account → Tenant Actor Resolution

actor User
participant Browser
participant "ERS API" as API
database "auth_sessions" as Sessions
database "auth_user_accounts" as Accounts
database "auth_account_actors" as Bindings
database "authz_actors" as Actors
database "Role Grants" as Grants

User -> Browser : Request Tenant-B resource

Browser -> API : GET /resource\nSession Cookie\nX-Tenant-ID: Tenant-B

API -> Sessions : Resolve Session
Sessions --> API : accountId

API -> Accounts : Load Account
Accounts --> API : Account

API -> Bindings : Find Actor for\naccountId + Tenant-B

alt no active Actor for Tenant-B
  Bindings --> API : none
  API --> Browser : 403 / no tenant access
else Actor exists
  Bindings --> API : actorId
  API -> Actors : Load Actor
  Actors --> API : Tenant-B Actor

  API -> Grants : Resolve Tenant-B grants
  Grants --> API : delegated permissions

  API -> API : Apply intrinsic self-service\n+ delegated authorization
  API --> Browser : Authorized response
end

note right of Bindings
Bite 30C authoritative
Account → Actor binding.
end note

note bottom of API
Tenant A can never silently
fall back to Tenant B's Actor.
end note

@enduml